+  - Scope is confined to `downloader/youtube.py`. Do not touch `bot/handlers.py`, `bot/keyboards.py`, or the pending-selection logic to chase this — none of that layer is implicated, and touching it risks colliding with Track A's delivery-pipeline work happening in parallel.
